a("D07","commonly ... inartistic in color","With NOT fixed before the aspect, 'commonly not artistic' and 'not commonly artistic' cannot be told apart.",G,2,"negation scope","Allow NOT directly before any phrase or modifier, not only clause-initially.")
a("D07","their flowers, which are commonly badly designed","A side comment on a noun cannot be attached to it because KIND clauses always narrow; it must become separate sentences.",W,1,"non-restrictive modification","Add linker NOTE for a clause that comments without narrowing.")
a("D07","badly designed, inartistic in color, and ill-smelling","A list of three predicates of one subject needs three full sentences.",W,2,"coordination","Allow AND between blocks at body level, parallel to OR.")
