a("D11","in particular circumstances / a particular item","'Certain specific ones, not just any' is reduced to SOME or to nothing.",G,1,"specificity","Add quantifier CERTAIN-ONE, e.g. SPECIFIC, beside SOME.")
a("D11","any behavior described with this label","Free-choice 'any' is rendered ALL, which is close here but not the same in general.",W,1,"genericity","Quantifier ANY.")
