a("D11","One vendor may choose ... another vendor may omit","POSSIBLE means the writer thinks it may be so; the source means the vendor is free to do it. Permission and guess are merged.",G,3,"modality","Modal MAY (permitted) distinct from strength POSSIBLE.")
a("D11","because a particular marketplace requires it or because the vendor feels","Two alternative reasons need the whole main clause written twice inside OR.",W,2,"coordination","Allow OR between phrases under one role.")
a("D11","This word, or the adjective \"RECOMMENDED\", mean","Two terms defined together as equals need a second DEFINE that makes one depend on the other.",W,1,"coordination","Allow DEFINE term OR term BE ...")
